WEBVTT

00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:05.710
Kanami-chan! Hiyori-chan!

00:00:05.710 --> 00:00:07.440
The gate is closing...

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:08.980
Yanase, lend me your shoulder.

00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:16.730
Even if I put my whole being and 
all my Toji powers into it...

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:23.120
Please cleanse and purify 
all the misfortune, sin,

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:25.010
and impurity!

00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:25.990
Yukari-sama!

00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:26.990
Wait!

00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:31.010
These are our wishes we most 
humbly and respectfully pray!

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:50.990
Yukari-sama?

00:00:50.990 --> 00:00:53.310
Hey! What about Kanami and Hiyori?!

00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:58.150
Juujou and Etou... did their duty.

00:00:58.420 --> 00:01:00.570
Then they're both...

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:05.660
God damn it!

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:24.800
<b>Katana Maidens</b>

00:01:25.220 --> 00:01:30.560
<b>Episode 24  The United Maidens</b>

00:01:26.890 --> 00:01:29.230
<i>After the "End of the Year Disaster,"</i>

00:01:29.230 --> 00:01:33.170
<i>the severe criticism against 
the Sword Administration Bureau</i>

00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:35.730
<i>from the public became even more intense,</i>

00:01:35.730 --> 00:01:38.480
<i>but with an increase in the 
frequency of aradama appearances,</i>

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:41.650
<i>the need for Toji to be dispatched also grew.</i>

00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:45.190
The Yonemura and Ogawa units 
will head to the main office.

00:01:45.190 --> 00:01:47.030
The Iwakura unit will go to Tachikawa.

00:01:47.030 --> 00:01:48.410
All units dispatch!

00:01:48.690 --> 00:01:49.410
Yes, ma'am!

00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:51.870
The raid squad will go in the first car,
the defensive squad in the second.

00:01:51.140 --> 00:01:52.990
The attack squad will go in the sixth car.

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:53.790
Everyone, follow me.

00:01:53.790 --> 00:01:55.120
<i>It has been two months since then.</i>

00:01:55.690 --> 00:02:00.370
<i>Both Etou Kanami and Juujou Hiyori</i>

00:02:00.370 --> 00:02:02.110
<i>are still considered missing.</i>

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:12.810
<i>And yet, everyone still 
believes they will surely...</i>

00:02:19.470 --> 00:02:21.730
Hiyori-chan?

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:27.150
How much time has passed since then?

00:02:37.180 --> 00:02:40.690
My... house?

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:44.510
Dad?

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:46.620
Brother?

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:51.250
No one's here...

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:55.890
Kanami?

00:02:58.270 --> 00:03:01.450
This is my home?

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:02.880
What is going on?

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:06.460
Mom's shoes and mine...

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:11.440
I see, so this is the home from my memories.

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:20.490
Even the feeling and the smell... 
It's almost like it's the real thing.

00:03:27.590 --> 00:03:30.190
I wonder how many days it's been.

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:31.300
And Kanami...

00:03:33.640 --> 00:03:38.460
<i>I will go with you, even though I don't 
believe we will get lost in your loneliness.</i>

00:03:38.870 --> 00:03:42.080
<i>Your life alone isn't even remotely enough.</i>

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:44.650
<i>The entire world will go along with me.</i>

00:03:45.610 --> 00:03:46.790
<i>I'm sorry, Kanami.</i>

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:48.560
<i>I lied to you.</i>

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:49.660
<i>I know you did.</i>

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:54.430
In Shinkage style, the 
final blow is delivered

00:03:54.430 --> 00:03:56.500
so that you won't need to strike twice.

00:03:57.050 --> 00:03:59.980
I can't give you everything, 
nor can Hiyori-chan.

00:04:00.570 --> 00:04:03.460
I will give you half my life instead.

00:04:03.460 --> 00:04:04.590
Kanami!

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:07.130
I promised to take half, didn't I?

00:04:07.130 --> 00:04:10.630
So another generation meets 
the same end as their parents.

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:13.510
It's a curious twist of fate, 
isn't it, Princess Tagitsu?

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:19.920
Fate...

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:21.780
Hiyori-chan!

00:04:23.480 --> 00:04:24.410
Right.

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:35.310
Oh, Kanami... so that was your plan all along.

00:04:36.030 --> 00:04:38.160
You knew what I was going to do.

00:04:38.830 --> 00:04:40.370
You idiot!

00:04:40.370 --> 00:04:44.350
That's what you meant by 
carrying half the load.

00:04:45.870 --> 00:04:48.880
Just like our mothers, we have...

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:55.500
I wish I could see her just one more time.

00:04:56.970 --> 00:05:00.240
Then I would definitely...

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:02.480
Excuse me...

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:03.770
Who's there?!

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:07.650
Who are you?

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:10.650
Mom?

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:12.910
Mom?

00:05:13.570 --> 00:05:15.740
I-I'm Hiyori!

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:17.410
Juujou Hiyori.

00:05:17.410 --> 00:05:18.430
I am your...

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:22.540
I am Hiiragi Kagari's daughter!

00:05:23.180 --> 00:05:24.290
Huh?

00:05:25.020 --> 00:05:28.350
Oh, so this is your house?

00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:31.520
You wouldn't know about it, moth—master.

00:05:31.520 --> 00:05:33.860
My mother and father got married,

00:05:33.860 --> 00:05:37.390
and then had my brother and 
me after they moved here.

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:41.600
Ugh, I really don't want to 
picture it. Not with that guy.

00:05:41.960 --> 00:05:45.100
You knew my father even back then?

00:05:46.590 --> 00:05:49.360
He's a classmate I've kinda been stuck with.

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:51.820
How could I end up with a guy like that?

00:05:51.820 --> 00:05:55.030
I'm sure there was a miraculous 
reversal of fortune.

00:05:55.030 --> 00:05:57.330
My father and mother were totally in love!

00:05:57.330 --> 00:05:59.170
Yuck...

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:05.670
But you were born thanks to that.

00:06:05.940 --> 00:06:07.540
I was.

00:06:07.920 --> 00:06:09.750
Then it's fine.

00:06:11.070 --> 00:06:13.630
You're so easygoing, as always.

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:15.340
U-Um...

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:18.260
You're the version of my mother 
from the great disaster,

00:06:18.260 --> 00:06:21.490
so that pretty much makes you 
a different person from my mom.

00:06:21.930 --> 00:06:24.350
B-Besides, having someone not very 
much different from you in age

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:26.080
suddenly saying she's your daughter is—

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:27.150
Kogarasumaru...

00:06:29.390 --> 00:06:32.230
You were also chosen 
by Kogarasumaru, weren't you?

00:06:33.180 --> 00:06:36.260
It didn't come to me through 
official procedures.

00:06:36.260 --> 00:06:39.490
I inherited it from my mom,
 the you from my time.

00:06:39.490 --> 00:06:41.700
From me?

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:45.130
And this, too.

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:49.330
This is the one I used.

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:50.040
Yes.

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:52.880
I brought it with me from 
the Hiiragi household

00:06:53.150 --> 00:06:55.760
when I went to go serve 
alongside Yukari-sama.

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:59.600
We both wield Kogarasumaru.

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:02.670
Mostly likely, you are the one who is real,

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:05.850
while I am just a spirit of the netherworld.

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:11.110
It doesn't exist in the real
world, just like me.

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:13.610
Doesn't exist in the real world?

00:07:14.310 --> 00:07:16.740
Chidori and Kogarasumaru.

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:20.070
I did not think there would 
be anyone in the present day

00:07:20.430 --> 00:07:22.290
like both Fujiwara Minato and Hiiragi Kagari.

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:24.620
So that's what she meant!

00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:26.880
Just like you split off from my mom,

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:29.570
Kogarasumaru also split in two!

00:07:29.570 --> 00:07:32.840
And what's missing is supplemented 
by something in the netherworld...

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:36.170
Is this what it means to 
be similar to an aradama?

00:07:36.570 --> 00:07:37.710
Split in two...

00:07:38.510 --> 00:07:42.430
It would be the same Chidori that 
Kanami, no, Minato-san used.

00:07:42.430 --> 00:07:46.600
Chidori? Then Minato-senpai 
met the same fate as me?

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:51.480
So you cut through Hiyori-chan's lightning.

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:54.650
Then it's no longer Chidori, but Raikiri.

00:07:54.650 --> 00:07:56.990
You also wielded Chidori, didn't you?

00:07:57.450 --> 00:08:02.210
We might've even been able to meet 
because we both wield Chidori.

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:03.740
That's true!

00:08:03.740 --> 00:08:04.660
Huh?

00:08:04.660 --> 00:08:06.370
This is...

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:10.120
So Minato-senpai... I see.

00:08:10.490 --> 00:08:12.400
That's what happened over there.

00:08:12.920 --> 00:08:17.010
My utter uselessness even got 
Minato-senpai dragged into things.

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:21.180
B-But you were able to defeat 
Princess Tagitsu in the end.

00:08:21.530 --> 00:08:23.260
What about Yukari-sama?

00:08:23.260 --> 00:08:25.730
She was with us till the final battle.

00:08:27.160 --> 00:08:29.180
Do you hate Yukari-sama?

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:31.690
My mom...

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:35.650
In my world, you always deeply 
regretted what happened.

00:08:35.650 --> 00:08:38.450
That you were never fully able 
to defeat Princess Tagitsu

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:42.200
and for getting Kanami's mother,
 Minato-san, involved.

00:08:42.590 --> 00:08:43.190
That is—

00:08:43.190 --> 00:08:45.730
The memory of seeing my mom

00:08:45.730 --> 00:08:49.830
breaking down on the phone at the news 
of Minato-san's death still haunts me.

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:55.120
Years later, when my mom was in her sickbed,

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:57.340
she hardly ever smiled.

00:08:57.340 --> 00:09:00.190
Sometimes she would mutter in her nightmares

00:09:00.590 --> 00:09:03.090
that she had to destroy the 
great aradama, Origami Yukari.

00:09:14.260 --> 00:09:17.310
I see, and so that's why your 
understanding was mistaken.

00:09:17.310 --> 00:09:17.860
Huh?

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:21.860
I was saved by Minato-senpai and Yukari-sama.

00:09:22.990 --> 00:09:28.120
Originally, I was supposed to send Princess 
Tagitsu to the netherworld on my own.

00:09:28.470 --> 00:09:33.550
But Minato-senpai took on part of 
the burden and shortened her life.

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:38.880
And so she saved me, the other me, and...

00:09:38.880 --> 00:09:41.340
Now I'm here.

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:46.230
And together, we were able to rival 
Princess Tagitsu's strength.

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:49.390
No, Princess Tagitsu was a bit better.

00:09:49.390 --> 00:09:53.020
Yukari-sama was the one who kept 
her back from the real world.

00:09:53.390 --> 00:09:57.410
Instead, by giving up her 
body for twenty years,

00:09:57.410 --> 00:09:59.280
she is the one who suffered the most.

00:10:01.070 --> 00:10:06.030
That is why I hope that you, 
Hiyori-san, won't hate her.

00:10:08.450 --> 00:10:13.270
Perhaps this place we are in is 
a small gap in the netherworld.

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:16.850
I think it might have been created 
by the combined force of myself,

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:20.400
Minato-senpai, Yukari-sama, 
and Princess Tagitsu.

00:10:21.150 --> 00:10:24.530
But if Princess Tagitsu is 
sent to the netherworld,

00:10:24.530 --> 00:10:27.210
even this place will 
disappear into its depths.

00:10:28.280 --> 00:10:32.300
That makes sense. I'm glad 
I got to see you in the end.

00:10:33.030 --> 00:10:37.350
Um, Hiyori-san, can you tell me some things

00:10:37.350 --> 00:10:39.310
about the version of myself from that world?

00:10:40.840 --> 00:10:43.970
I loved the stewed dishes my mom would make,

00:10:43.970 --> 00:10:46.480
and she taught me how to make soup stock.

00:10:46.480 --> 00:10:50.700
I learned how to make it 
from my mom, your grandma.

00:10:51.160 --> 00:10:52.540
You told me that.

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:55.440
It's so strange.

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:59.860
You know so much about 
my future that I don't.

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:01.040
Indeed.

00:11:02.190 --> 00:11:03.800
What is this sound?

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:05.090
It's resonating?

00:11:05.090 --> 00:11:08.590
That means that Kanami might be close by!

00:11:10.350 --> 00:11:13.350
It did it again, and it's getting stronger.

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:15.470
Could Hiyori-chan be close?

00:11:15.470 --> 00:11:15.980
Huh?

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:19.140
Chidori was guiding me 
even when I came here,

00:11:19.140 --> 00:11:20.980
and I ran into you.

00:11:20.980 --> 00:11:23.860
That's why I'm sure it's guiding me again!

00:11:23.860 --> 00:11:26.300
Hiyori-chan!

00:11:32.490 --> 00:11:34.700
Hiyori-chan...

00:11:34.700 --> 00:11:36.140
Kanami...

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:39.380
Hiyori-chan!

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:40.420
Kanami!

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:46.630
Kanami, I thought I'd never see you again.

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:49.890
Hiyori-chan! Thank goodness!

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:51.360
Thank goodness!

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:58.270
It has been quite some time, Minato-senpai.

00:11:58.550 --> 00:12:00.410
Long time no see, Kagari.

00:12:02.550 --> 00:12:05.330
Minato-senpai, I...

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:10.290
I... I'm sorry.

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:12.990
There, there.

00:12:15.510 --> 00:12:18.610
I'm so glad I got to see you again, Kagari.

00:12:22.710 --> 00:12:24.340
So you're Hiyori-chan?

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:25.200
Yes.

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:27.410
You're exactly like I'd pictured.

00:12:27.410 --> 00:12:29.010
What did you tell her?

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:30.760
N-Nothing...

00:12:31.900 --> 00:12:33.890
You're totally like Kagari.

00:12:33.890 --> 00:12:36.850
Kanami-san also looks a lot like you.

00:12:36.850 --> 00:12:38.750
She does not.

00:12:38.750 --> 00:12:42.750
Kanami is more of the cute type,
while I'm the sexy type.

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:46.270
Are you actually the sexy type?

00:12:46.270 --> 00:12:47.530
Then what am I?

00:12:47.530 --> 00:12:48.710
The ill-mannered type.

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:52.320
Kagari! Jeez, you haven't changed at all.

00:12:56.280 --> 00:13:00.910
But I'm glad we were able to 
have such adorable daughters,

00:13:01.370 --> 00:13:03.670
right, Kagari?

00:13:04.650 --> 00:13:05.670
Yes.

00:13:07.630 --> 00:13:11.050
Come on, Kagari, say her name.

00:13:12.990 --> 00:13:15.300
Hiyori... san...

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:18.690
She's your daughter,
you don't need to use "san."

00:13:20.710 --> 00:13:24.600
H-Hiyori...

00:13:27.390 --> 00:13:29.730
Okay, now you call her "Mom," Hiyori-chan.

00:13:29.730 --> 00:13:32.910
What?! But you always hate 
it when I call you that.

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:34.450
This is different.

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:43.980
Mom...

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:46.380
Hiyori...

00:13:50.360 --> 00:13:51.300
This is...

00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:55.200
Perhaps the small gaps that are 
drifting around in the netherworld

00:13:55.200 --> 00:13:56.970
are being sucked into its depths.

00:13:57.430 --> 00:14:00.850
Mother, I'm glad I get to 
be with you at the end.

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:02.370
What are you talking about?

00:14:02.370 --> 00:14:02.990
Huh?

00:14:02.990 --> 00:14:04.690
You two are going back.

00:14:04.690 --> 00:14:07.060
But how are we supposed to get back?

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:10.310
How? I'm not exactly sure.

00:14:10.310 --> 00:14:11.320
Wha?

00:14:11.630 --> 00:14:15.270
No one who's ever gone to the ends 
of the netherworld has come back.

00:14:15.270 --> 00:14:17.090
Who said something like that?

00:14:17.090 --> 00:14:19.310
There is no precedent for going back.

00:14:19.310 --> 00:14:20.370
That so?

00:14:20.370 --> 00:14:24.000
But it might be possible for you two,
 since your bodies still exist.

00:14:26.290 --> 00:14:27.760
For that...

00:14:32.940 --> 00:14:35.090
I knew it'd come to this.

00:14:35.090 --> 00:14:37.710
Why are we doing this exactly?

00:14:37.710 --> 00:14:40.310
To sever as many lingering 
attachments as possible,

00:14:40.640 --> 00:14:43.230
since they might be what is 
keeping you from going back.

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:44.720
Lingering attachments?

00:14:44.720 --> 00:14:46.130
She says that,

00:14:46.130 --> 00:14:49.560
but I know that you're just itching 
to fight with me, too, aren't you?

00:14:50.760 --> 00:14:52.230
You saw right through me?

00:14:52.550 --> 00:14:54.900
A mom sees through everything.

00:14:54.900 --> 00:14:56.070
Let's do this.

00:14:56.070 --> 00:14:57.780
Bring it on!

00:15:12.750 --> 00:15:16.510
You're so strong. I can't beat you at all.

00:15:17.660 --> 00:15:20.680
Really? You won't get back 
with an attitude like that.

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:29.770
I will get back to everyone...

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:32.730
Along with Hiyori-chan!

00:15:33.060 --> 00:15:34.820
That's the spirit!

00:15:37.420 --> 00:15:39.630
Shall we spar, as well?

00:15:39.630 --> 00:15:41.320
No, I...

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:42.620
Too slow!

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:45.890
That's probably part of 
what makes you like me.

00:15:47.930 --> 00:15:50.510
There is something I want 
to ask you, though.

00:15:50.910 --> 00:15:51.960
What is it?

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:56.210
Do you regret anything?

00:15:57.590 --> 00:15:58.890
Hmm...

00:16:00.550 --> 00:16:03.970
Hiyori, are you happy now?

00:16:05.640 --> 00:16:06.940
I am.

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:10.990
Because I have people—friends—
dear to me, who are willing

00:16:11.630 --> 00:16:13.850
to help me carry the 
load when things get tough.

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:18.390
I see. Then I don't regret anything.

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:27.030
Owie... I lost.

00:16:27.030 --> 00:16:30.620
Even you have surprising moments of weakness.

00:16:30.620 --> 00:16:34.000
That inconsistency is 
the nature of your sword.

00:16:35.080 --> 00:16:37.630
That's why I didn't win 
at the tournament, either.

00:16:37.900 --> 00:16:40.790
But you've beaten me countless times.

00:16:41.220 --> 00:16:44.050
Yep, that's right.

00:16:44.550 --> 00:16:48.090
Which means you're as strong as me now.

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:50.190
You're a full master.

00:16:52.120 --> 00:16:53.690
Thank you!

00:17:00.280 --> 00:17:01.700
Use this if you get lost.

00:17:02.150 --> 00:17:03.070
This is?

00:17:03.450 --> 00:17:06.800
You should be able to get back if 
you think hard about everyone.

00:17:06.800 --> 00:17:07.790
Master!

00:17:08.580 --> 00:17:11.020
My sweet, sweet, Kanami.

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:14.880
I wish I could've held 
you with my actual body,

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:18.340
but the sword is everything to me,
 and I committed myself to it.

00:17:18.670 --> 00:17:21.340
Mother!

00:17:27.130 --> 00:17:28.210
Hiyori...

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:30.190
Mom...

00:17:31.880 --> 00:17:33.230
Mom!

00:17:39.210 --> 00:17:42.200
You can't look back once you've gone ahead.

00:17:42.480 --> 00:17:44.910
Right. Let's go, Kanami.

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:45.700
Okay.

00:17:46.030 --> 00:17:48.660
See ya! Take care of yourselves!

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:50.730
You, too, Mother!

00:17:53.290 --> 00:17:56.080
How am I supposed to do that?

00:17:56.080 --> 00:17:58.180
But you've always been in good health.

00:17:58.180 --> 00:17:59.000
I guess...

00:18:00.860 --> 00:18:02.090
Looking at those two,

00:18:02.630 --> 00:18:06.090
I start to get a sense of just 
how happy we were over there.

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:07.420
Yes.

00:18:07.990 --> 00:18:10.970
Hey! Why don't you come and join us?

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:13.810
You're here with us, too, aren't you?

00:18:13.810 --> 00:18:16.160
Do you wanna have a bout before we disappear?

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:18.730
I'm sure you're still 
sore about me beating you.

00:18:20.590 --> 00:18:25.360
Okay, then, though we don't know 
how much time we have left.

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:30.470
Kanami?

00:18:30.470 --> 00:18:32.330
It's all right. I'm here.

00:18:33.110 --> 00:18:34.710
Don't let go of my hand.

00:18:34.710 --> 00:18:36.800
I know. I won't.

00:18:37.820 --> 00:18:39.670
Think of everyone...

00:18:39.670 --> 00:18:44.170
Mai-chan, Sayaka-chan, 
Kaoru-chan, Ellen-chan...

00:18:44.450 --> 00:18:46.180
Oh, right! I have this...

00:18:54.670 --> 00:18:55.700
Let's follow it.

00:18:55.700 --> 00:18:56.440
Okay.

00:19:03.690 --> 00:19:13.190
One, two, one, two, one, two...

00:19:10.110 --> 00:19:13.190
Come on, everyone!
Keep bringing your arms down.

00:19:13.190 --> 00:19:14.940
Right!

00:19:14.940 --> 00:19:22.050
One, two, one, two, one, two...

00:19:17.190 --> 00:19:21.090
<i>Kanami-chan, it's the perfect 
time to see the cherry blossoms.</i>

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:28.680
The passport to the outside world 
originally belonged to them.

00:19:24.050 --> 00:19:27.550
<b>Special Rare Metals Research Institute</b>

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:30.550
We can be good neighbors to them,

00:19:30.550 --> 00:19:33.700
since they have nowhere else to go.

00:19:33.700 --> 00:19:37.380
Don't worry. They'll understand 
when they see Kaoru and Nene.

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:38.670
They will.

00:19:40.550 --> 00:19:44.190
<i>Damn it! Kaoru! Where are you slacking off at?</i>

00:19:44.190 --> 00:19:46.240
I'm on a security mission.

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:48.360
<i>But you're the commander of the raid squad!</i>

00:19:48.610 --> 00:19:51.450
It'll be fine if you just 
leave it up to Sayaka.

00:19:51.450 --> 00:19:54.290
<b>Director Maniwa</b>

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:52.750
End transmission.

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:54.290
<i>Hey!</i>

00:19:54.650 --> 00:19:58.050
That little—! I'll let her 
have it when she gets back.

00:19:58.050 --> 00:20:00.290
Things are so tough for you, Sana-chan.

00:20:00.290 --> 00:20:02.640
They really are!

00:20:02.640 --> 00:20:04.880
And I have to continue being director.

00:20:05.250 --> 00:20:08.590
You seem to have gotten pretty 
used to your role, at any rate.

00:20:10.070 --> 00:20:12.300
I want a vacation and a raise.

00:20:13.290 --> 00:20:15.810
Prioritize evacuating anyone nearby!

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:17.890
All units, spread out immediately!

00:20:17.890 --> 00:20:19.740
Attack once you're in configuration—

00:20:25.770 --> 00:20:29.070
Good night. You won't be lonely anymore.

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:30.890
Itomi-san...

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:33.580
From the special raid unit.

00:20:36.700 --> 00:20:38.380
Did you hear?

00:20:39.240 --> 00:20:44.240
Itomi Sayaka finished 
another mission by herself.

00:20:44.240 --> 00:20:47.760
Yeah, she's racked up a tremendous number 
of suppressions in such a short period.

00:20:48.230 --> 00:20:50.790
Almost like you did once.

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:54.530
Itomi is doing her best to fill in the 
gap left by Etou and Juujou's absence.

00:20:54.530 --> 00:20:56.260
She's very reliable.

00:20:56.830 --> 00:20:59.330
I should have been more like that.

00:20:59.870 --> 00:21:01.570
For Yume and Yomi both.

00:21:02.290 --> 00:21:05.280
Could you please stop talking 
as if you are the only surviving member

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:06.650
of the former elite guard?

00:21:07.550 --> 00:21:08.900
You're right.

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:11.280
Suzuka,

00:21:11.880 --> 00:21:15.030
we should get stronger, too. Together.

00:21:15.950 --> 00:21:17.820
O-Okay...

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:24.830
You can do this, Ayumu.

00:21:24.830 --> 00:21:25.690
I know.

00:21:28.590 --> 00:21:32.350
I'll do my best, so I can 
fight with Etou-san again!

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:35.950
Yomi...

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:37.510
Yukina.

00:21:38.310 --> 00:21:39.770
Yuzuki-senpai!

00:21:42.170 --> 00:21:43.290
This is...

00:21:44.030 --> 00:21:45.940
Management of Suijingiri Kanemitsu

00:21:45.940 --> 00:21:48.610
has been given to Renpu by Ayanokouji.

00:21:50.810 --> 00:21:54.320
Thank you...

00:21:55.580 --> 00:21:58.170
How is the reconstruction 
going on the noro shrines?

00:21:58.170 --> 00:21:59.440
It is going well.

00:21:59.440 --> 00:22:01.860
Each municipality has been cooperative,

00:22:01.860 --> 00:22:04.580
and many new shrines have 
been established, too.

00:22:04.580 --> 00:22:07.910
This way we will be getting 
closer to returning

00:22:07.910 --> 00:22:09.960
to the ancient ways of 
people and noro coexisting.

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:15.090
Ultimately, the things that 
Princess Tagitsu did changed people.

00:22:15.090 --> 00:22:19.560
When she returns here, whether after 
decades or hundreds of years,

00:22:19.560 --> 00:22:23.140
we will welcome her as a stable deity, 
a nigimitama, rather than an evil one.

00:22:24.040 --> 00:22:26.060
What about the search for Etou and Juujou?

00:22:26.450 --> 00:22:28.260
It's still ongoing.

00:22:28.260 --> 00:22:29.780
But we haven't found anything.

00:22:29.780 --> 00:22:32.630
Keep at it. Don't let the fire go out.

00:22:32.630 --> 00:22:33.570
We won't.

00:22:34.410 --> 00:22:36.220
The cherry blossoms are falling already.

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:39.920
Soon, the preliminaries for 
each school will begin.

00:22:39.920 --> 00:22:42.750
I'm sure Etou-san would've wanted 
to compete if she was here.

00:22:46.590 --> 00:22:48.240
The cherry blossoms...

00:22:48.940 --> 00:22:50.890
It's spring already.

00:22:51.320 --> 00:22:53.050
We're back, aren't we?

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:55.030
Yeah.

00:22:55.030 --> 00:22:57.090
I want to see them all right away.

00:22:58.230 --> 00:23:00.100
Can you imagine the looks on their faces?

00:23:00.470 --> 00:23:02.100
I'm sure they'll be surprised.

00:23:02.430 --> 00:23:04.910
What do you want to do first?

00:23:04.910 --> 00:23:06.730
You want to eat something that's
mint chocolate, don't you?

00:23:07.180 --> 00:23:09.900
Yeah, I do.

00:23:16.310 --> 00:23:18.020
Good luck.

00:23:30.360 --> 00:23:33.860
Will both the final competitors 
please come forward?

00:23:33.860 --> 00:23:34.850
Yes!
